      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ONLY RUMOURS (5) was safely held last time out, finishing seventh at this track over 320m behind Spring Sassy (19.10) in a Maiden. Placed at her previous run. Form from her last run is proving very strong. Should bounce back. CHEEKY JAMESON (4) generally breaks well and with clear running can clear the draw. Last start finished 4th on October 25 over 320m at this track behind Stormy Ninja beaten 8 lengths (19.02) in a Maiden. With even luck and a clean start should be thereabouts STAR GLOW (8) turned in a plain performance last time when sixth at this track over 320m behind Torqued (19.43) in a Maiden. Was in the money the start prior. Good beginner but will need a little luck early crossing from an outside draw. Expected to give a good account. GREENHOUSE GAS (2) was out of the frame here most recently but can atone.",
